    {
      "game": "Ace Combat 7: Skies Unknown - TOP GUN: Maverick Ultimate Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/11738/450x258/ace-combat-7-skies-unknown-top-gun-maverick-ultimate-edition-top-gun-maverick-ultimate-edition-pc-game-steam-cover.jpg?v=1792922400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/11738-buy-ace-combat-7-skies-unknown-top-gun-maverick-ultimate-edition-top-gun-maverick-ultimate-edition-pc-game-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-1f0e34",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Loved these series of games ever since original Playstation. This one is by far my favorite, mostly because of all the cool Top Gun stuff. Flight controls and maneuvering are very nice and change with every fighter plane. It's a lot of fun to bounce back and forth between planes so you don't get too used to just one unless that's what you like. But I like fighting with them all really."
    },
